  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Altered Beast I**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Deserted Dunes Welcome Weary Feet**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **The Castle in the Air**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Robot Stop**: with Cellophane tease [2]\n- **Some Context**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **KGATLW060918** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 82 min [1]. Said about its sound: Recording processed through Cep v.2.0, converting from 48kHz to 44.1kHz [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Cellophane tease [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **KGATLW060918**: taped by Ryan Teske; source: CSB + Edirol R-09 (@48kHz) [1]. Also: Recorded 60 feet from stage using shoulder-mounted mics and an Edirol R-09 recorder; Audio transferred from a SanDisk 4GB SDHC card via USB to Cd Wave software [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2018-06-09 Pabst Theater, Milwaukee, WI, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-june-9-2018-pabst-theater-milwaukee-wi-usa.html) [5]",
